<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Would? (2022 Remaster)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Alice In Chains</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Dirt (2022 Remaster)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5sFDReWLrZHLFZFjHsjUTS</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.450" end="00:38.050">Know me broken by my master</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.050" end="00:40.090" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.090" end="00:48.090">Teach thee on child of love hereafter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.620" end="00:52.050">Into the flood again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.050" end="00:57.970">Same old trip it was back then</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.970" end="01:01.120">So I made a big mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.120" end="01:05.430">Try to see it once my way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.430" end="01:13.430" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.050" end="01:35.050">Drifting body, it's sole desertion</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.460" end="01:44.460">Flying not yet, quite the notion</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.230" end="01:48.490">Into the flood again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.490" end="01:54.340">Same old trip it was back then</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.340" end="01:57.900">So I made a big mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.900" end="02:03.630">Try to see it once my way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.630" end="02:11.630" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.120" end="02:25.650">Into the flood again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.650" end="02:31.580">Same old trip it was back then</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.580" end="02:34.760">So I made a big mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.760" end="02:41.630">Try to see it once my way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.630" end="02:45.430">Am I wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.430" end="02:51.090">Have I run too far to get home?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.090" end="02:54.760">Have I gone?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.760" end="02:59.850">And left you here alone?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.850" end="03:03.570">Am I wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.570" end="03:08.930">Have I run too far to get home?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.930" end="03:12.410">Have I gone?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.410" end="03:17.210">And left you here alone?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.210" end="03:22.920">If I would, could you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.920" end="03:26.920" /></div></body></tt>